<title>USA: Chicago Dock stake cut by Cowen group.</title>
<headline>Chicago Dock stake cut by Cowen group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Cowen &amp; Co said Wednesday it reduced its stake in Chicago Dock &amp; Canal Trust to 176,900 common shares or 3.05 percent from 7.7 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 213,200 common shares between Oct 14 and Nov 8 at $20.25 to $20.50 per share.</p>
<p>The Chicago, Ill., company is an equity oriented REIT that owns undeveloped and underdeveloped land as well as income-producing property in Chicago and elsewhere.</p>
</text>
